Falsifies `globally_unique_identifier_partition_table::verification::create_never_lays_out_a_table_parse_would_reject`.

The defect: `create` sets `last_usable_lba` one block too high, so the last usable block is the first block of
the backup entry array. `parse` checks `last_usable + span < alternate` and refuses the table its
own writer just made.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!(h.last_usable_lba + span < h.alternate_lba)`.

